@title Route all: slotted ducts, wires round devices, wires along DIN rails
@area Cabinet
# Fixture: the example after Place all with a 25 mm slot pitch on every duct. Route all wires: a wire enters a duct at a slot, goes round the devices instead of through them, and runs along the DIN rail between devices on one rail. The Rails and ducts list (Ctrl+Shift+R) has a Slots column.
open qa/fixtures/route-slotted-ducts.novo
wait 20
click_text Cabinet #1
wait 30
key ctrl+k
wait 4
text Route all wires
wait 6
key Enter
wait 40
shot routed-slotted
check_layout
check_blank routed-slotted
key ctrl+shift+r
wait 10
shot rails-and-ducts-slots
check_layout
